{"dimension": 384, "max_elements": 100000, "ef_construction": 200, "m": 16, "ef_search": 50, "max_entries": null, "eviction_batch_size": 100, "eviction_count": 0, "memory_to_hnsw": {"2b6f6a1d-6ca5-4ffc-9dc6-b318883e3436": 0}, "hnsw_to_memory": {"0": "2b6f6a1d-6ca5-4ffc-9dc6-b318883e3436"}, "next_hnsw_id": 1, "metadata": {"2b6f6a1d-6ca5-4ffc-9dc6-b318883e3436": {"memory_id": "2b6f6a1d-6ca5-4ffc-9dc6-b318883e3436", "user_id": "quangdang", "session_id": null, "agent_id": null, "valid_until": null, "entity_refs": [], "content": "Quang ch\u1ed1t 2026-07-14: ClinicAI chuy\u1ec3n sang **m\u1ed7i nh\u00e2n vi\u00ean 1 login Supabase ri\u00eang**, populate `staff.auth_user_id` (link auth user \u2194 staff row), v\u00e0 **b\u1ecf role-picker** (cookie `clinic_role`/`clinic_staff_id`/`departmentToRole`).\n\n**Why:** backend `src/clinicai/api/identity.py` (Phase 4 #1a, commit 5e57d61) l\u00e0 c\u01a1 ch\u1ebf server-authoritative chu\u1ea9n \u2014 verify Supabase JWT \u2192 `staff.auth_user_id` \u2192 role t\u1eeb `staff.primary_department`. Nh\u01b0ng frontend `src/dashboard/lib/clinic-session.ts` hi\u1ec7n d\u00f9ng 1 login chung + role-picker v\u00e0 ghi r\u00f5 \"replaces the old staff.auth_user_id linkage\" \u2014 m\u00e2u thu\u1eabn tr\u1ef1c ti\u1ebfp. `staff.auth_user_id` \u0111ang nullable, ch\u01b0a populate \u2192 n\u1ebfu b\u1eadt `get_current_identity` b\u00e2y gi\u1edd s\u1ebd 403 cho t\u1ea5t c\u1ea3.\n\n**How to apply:** khi l\u00e0m C\u1ee5m B (identity/role tr\u00ean write), coi vi\u1ec7c migrate login ri\u00eang + populate `auth_user_id` + retire role-picker l\u00e0 **prerequisite v\u1eadn h\u00e0nh**. Trong l\u00fac ch\u01b0a xong: \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng proxy FastAPI c\u00f3 `require_role` ch\u1ec9 \u0111i khi `CLINIC_API_URL` set; ch\u01b0a set th\u00ec Next route gi\u1eef \u0111\u01b0\u1eddng direct-Supabase c\u0169 (fallback) \u0111\u1ec3 kh\u00f4ng v\u1ee1 prod. Kh\u00f4ng tin cookie role \u1edf backend. Xem [[plan-systemdesign-rightsized]].", "created_at": "2026-07-20T16:00:23.825133", "importance": 0.6, "metadata": {"source_agent": "claude", "source_file": "identity-model-per-staff-login.md", "content_hash": "d0b51ec047deea67", "synced_at": "2026-07-20T16:00:23.824952+00:00", "sync_direction": "import", "name": "identity-model-per-staff-login", "description": "ClinicAI auth end-state = per-staff Supabase logins + staff.auth_user_id, retiring the shared-login role-picker", "headroom_id": ""}}}, "embeddings": {"2b6f6a1d-6ca5-4ffc-9dc6-b318883e3436": [-0.11474890261888504, -0.003378588240593672, -0.05168895050883293, -0.06641063094139099, -0.016312597319483757, -0.056301046162843704, 0.04079006239771843, 0.01024706196039915, 0.04676610231399536, -0.02409014292061329, 0.09389123320579529, -0.0635669082403183, 0.04033524543046951, -0.0252788458019495, -0.021581709384918213, 0.01773674786090851, -0.01865544356405735, -0.035986121743917465, -0.031379327178001404, -0.06523988395929337, -0.08188346028327942, -0.01295244600623846, -0.02960856258869171, -0.009407653473317623, -0.007004764396697283, -0.13324706256389618, -0.012948757037520409, 0.025456225499510765, -0.004054842051118612, -0.02725215069949627, 0.020434947684407234, 0.12763257324695587, -0.06773164123296738, -0.024981549009680748, 0.021457428112626076, 0.05028342083096504, 0.016299622133374214, -0.01587548293173313, 0.07448868453502655, 0.018550347536802292, 0.012488066218793392, -0.015969494357705116, -0.04749679192900658, -0.004454286769032478, -0.010084979236125946, -0.01822633482515812, -0.04296195134520531, -0.013047544285655022, -0.04320463538169861, 0.028382955119013786, -0.03929433971643448, 0.016962610185146332, 0.03496922180056572, 0.05523066967725754, -0.09412351250648499, 0.07106310874223709, -0.07292462140321732, 0.01704537682235241, -0.02109738625586033, -0.011545611545443535, -0.015259770676493645, -0.0033820681273937225, -0.012778138741850853, -0.03050229512155056, 0.008452617563307285, -0.10377074033021927, 0.01036062277853489, -0.0695677176117